# Cursor Rules for AI Reports Hub

When creating or modifying reports:
- Always put new reports in their own folder: `/[report_name]/index.html`.
- Use self-contained HTML with Tailwind CSS CDN, Chart.js CDN, and dark mode theme (`bg-slate-950`).
- Always register the new report on the root `index.html` hub by adding a card linking to `./[report_name]/`.
- Commit and push to GitHub `main` branch to trigger live auto-deploy on Cloudflare, Vercel, and Netlify.
